WHICH DOWNLOAD CONTAINS WHICH

This repository distributes two programs, and each carries its own
third-party software:

  fettle-<version>-<os>.zip / .tar.gz    CONTAINS PdfPig, listed below
  burler-<version>-<os>.zip / .tar.gz    CONTAINS ONNX Runtime and
                                         Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers, below

The two are separate archives on purpose. burler is optional: it is only
wanted by somebody who has switched the disclosure screen on, and fettle
runs perfectly well without it. Folding burler into fettle's archive would
make every download pay for ONNX Runtime to get a feature most trees never
use. fettle looks for burler BESIDE ITSELF, so the two unpack into one
directory when both are wanted.

NO MODEL WEIGHTS ARE DISTRIBUTED BY THIS PROJECT, in any archive. The
screening models burler runs are downloaded by whoever uses them and
placed in a directory they name; their licences and provenance are
recorded in that directory's own manifest. Nothing here redistributes
them, so no obligation attaching to their redistribution is incurred.

