Used by: burler alone, to run named-entity models over a payload the
disclosure screen is about to return. fettle does not reference it.

Why it is not in fettle: ONNX Runtime ships native per-RID binaries, and
fettle's package allowlist admits only pure managed assemblies because
fettle publishes self-contained and single-file. That is the whole reason
burler is a separate program rather than a class.
